menu "BT2PS2 bridge"

    config BT2PS2_MOUSE_TRACE
        bool "Trace every mouse report on the console (latency BLE -> PS/2 done, queue depth)"
        default n
        help
            Logs one line per mouse report at INFO level after the PS/2 packet has been
            sent: dx, dy, wheel, buttons, latency from BLE receipt to PS/2 completion in
            microseconds, and how many reports were still queued. Diagnostic only; it
            costs ~60 bytes of UART per report.

endmenu
